#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/2-fa_py_libraries.md:16
#: e30070e3c8814f5b9f8f74a0ac64ea94
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/2-fa_py_libraries.md:18
#: 8c80e930b3024cde95d7f6a0d860478b
msgid ""
"git clone https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-py-libraries.git\n"
"cd fa-py-libraries\n"
"./init.sh all"
msgstr ""
"git clone https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-py-libraries.git\n"
"cd fa-py-libraries\n"
"./init.sh all"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/2-fa_py_libraries.md:24
#: 0e6c6978a43e48498050cd569b42834a
msgid ""
"What `./init.sh all` does: initialize submodules, create a Python **3.12** "
"env (from `.fa-env.toml` `backend`: `uv` or `conda`), then install "
"`ros2_robot_interface`, `ros2-viser`, and `vr_pose_publisher`."
msgstr ""
"`./init.sh all` 做什么：初始化子模块，按 `.fa-env.toml` 的 `backend`（`uv` 或 `conda`）创建 "
"Python **3.12** 环境，然后安装 `ros2_robot_interface`、`ros2-viser` 和 "
"`vr_pose_publisher`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/2-fa_py_libraries.md:26
#: e745eea6fcfb453dbca47404a1bcded1
msgid ""
"Switch backend with `./init.sh set-backend uv`. Personal overrides: `.fa-"
"env.local.toml`."
msgstr "用 `./init.sh set-backend uv` 切换 backend。个人覆盖：`.fa-env.local.toml`。"

